        <p class="text-walnut" style="text-align: center;" data-editable="source" data-path="/src/pages/about.njk" data-key="philosophy_desc">
          The word Yoga is derived from the Sanskrit root 'Yuj' meaning to yoke, unite or join together. It is the union of the individual consciousness with the universal consciousness. Yoga is a 5000-year-old body of knowledge from India that encompasses the complete science of life &mdash; physical, mental, emotional and spiritual.
